        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Excellent service, always cleared quickly after the plow has passed, and even before if the plow is late. He also comes back the same day and the next. Philippe is very hardworking, and the snow removal is always done well. He works through the night and comes back during the day, the next day, and sometimes even the day after a major storm. Thank you for the excellent snow removal service!\n\nWe also contracted him to build a stone retaining wall and raise our property line. It was very well done; every detail counts, and the project was completed very professionally. I highly recommend Philippe!",
        "time": 1768690369,
        "translated": true
      },
